 in several situations and changed how wardrobes work. If you're enjoying the game Please add Hotel Carnivalia to your wishlist and follow it on Steam. Open the Steam store page Main changes Choose your language when you first launch the game We've added a language selector to the top left of the \"Welcome to Hotel Carnivalia\" window show","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:25:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028350","verified_at":"2026-10-21T15:16:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5086950-1846651706693863","game_id":"steam-5086950","kind":"update","title":"Hotel Carnivalia Demo Update 0.1.46","summary":"Hey everyone. We're DARELARK Studio, the team making Hotel Carnivalia.Thank you to every guest who has checked in to the demo. Demo update 0.1.46 is now live. Here's what changed.If your game version isn't 0.1.46, please update to the latest version on Steam before you play.Major changesAI botsYou can now play with bots, even when no other players are around. Bots talk to each other and respond to your chat. They walk the rooms and the Lobby on their own, and they act according to their role, th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:10:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693863","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5086950-1846651706681094","game_id":"steam-5086950","kind":"update","title":"Hotel Carnivalia Demo Update 0.1.43","summary":"Hey everyone. We're DARELARK Studio, the team making Hotel Carnivalia.Thank you to every guest who has checked in to the demo. Demo update 0.1.43 is now live. Here's what changed.Major changesDoctorUse your ability on the body of someone who died that day to revive them.RoomsIf a room's Breaker Box is broken, the room now also looks dark when you open its door from the Lobby.New features and improvementsYou can now aim your gun before you fire.When you aim the shotgun, the crosshair now shows ho","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T11:34:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681094","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5086950-1846651706673060","game_id":"steam-5086950","kind":"announcement","title":"The Hotel Carnivalia demo is now live","summary":"Hey everyone. We're DARELARK Studio, the team making Hotel Carnivalia.Thanks for waiting. The Hotel Carnivalia demo has been live since October 13 at 7:00 PM Steam time (PDT), which is October 14, 02:00 UTC. Download it from the store page and you can check in right away.Getting startedPress Start Game on the title screen and you'll see three options.Create Lobby: Open a new room and share the lobby code with your friends. Up to 15 players can join a single room.Find Lobby: Pick a room from the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T03:36:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673060","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5086950-1846018067936351","game_id":"steam-5086950","kind":"announcement","title":"The Hotel Carnivalia demo opens October 13","summary":"Hey everyone. We're DARELARK Studio, the team making Hotel Carnivalia.We've got two pieces of news today: when the demo launches, and a look at every role you'll meet in it.Demo launchThe Hotel Carnivalia demo goes live on October 13 at 7:00 PM Steam time (Pacific Daylight Time, PDT). That's October 14, 02:00 UTC.We put this demo together for Steam Next Fest, so it will close when Next Fest ends. Make sure you stop by while the hotel doors are open.Add the game to your wishlist and you'll get a ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T14:03:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936351","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5086950-1842846814442886","game_id":"steam-5086950","kind":"announcement","title":"The Hotel Carnivalia Steam page is live","summary":"Hey everyone. We're DARELARK Studio, the team making Hotel Carnivalia.Our Steam store page is finally live. Getting the build out of our office and onto this page took way longer than we thought it would. It feels great to finally put the name and the screenshots out there and actually talk about them.So what is itHotel Carnivalia is a 15 player first person social deduction game. You get invited into a gothic hotel and handed one of around 24 roles. Be a predator and hunt your prey, or be prey ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T10:35:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814442886","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5086950":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:57Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:57Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5086950":"2026-10-26T08:01:57Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5086950":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:57Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:57Z"},"5318800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:57Z","status":"ok","error_cod